/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The event was attended by 55 participants, selected from the South Asian Climate Justice fellowship. These participants, aged 18-35, represented South Asian countries, a diverse mix of ethnicities, genders, and identities. Out of the 55 participants, 13 were foreigners and 42 were from Nepal. The country representation was also broad, with participants coming from Nepal, India, Bangladesh, Sri Lanka, Bhutan and Maldives. This diversity created an inclusive and dynamic environment for learning, collaboration, and innovation. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [15 16]
>>
