/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Alongside the technical discussions on climate change, the camp also hosted a Cultural Exchange Night to celebrate diversity and foster collective bonding. Participants showcased performances that included traditional attire, dances, and songs from different backgrounds. The evening created a vibrant space for sharing and appreciating all the different cultures present there, emphasizing the spirit of unity and collaboration. It highlighted that while climate change is a serious issue, addressing it requires solidarity and a strong sense of community. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [19 20]
